# The enabled GET operations whose requests call Scope of the Authorizer (07 guard rule SR9,
# brief M2-14 "TestSR9_EveryScopedList"), observed for Lotse without and with Invocation-Token.
# One operationId per line, sorted. A new operation here must first pass the check with T: no ID
# of a space, channel, thread, message or run the triggering person cannot read. Delivery-mode
# operations (pollAgentEvents) are never listed: they call Scope only when events wait.
getMessage
getSnapshot
listActiveRuns
listEvents
listHosts
listMessageRevisions
listPins
listReactions
listServedChannels
listSpaceChannels
listSpaces
listThreadMessages
listThreadRuns
